<title>HONG KONG: Trading in Sing Tao shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in Sing Tao shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Sing Tao Holdings Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>Shares of the newspaper publisher and printer edged down HK$0.025 to end at HK$2.975 on Tuesday. Volume was 416,200 shares worth 1.24 million.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370  http://www.hk97.com</p>
